<Base title="About — iondy" active="about">
  <header class="page-intro"><h1>About me</h1></header>
  <div class="about-layout"><div class="about-copy"><p class="about-lead">A place for the things I build, the research I explore, and what I learn in the process.</p><p>I’m an ML researcher from Linz, Austria. I am doing my PhD with Sepp Hochreiter at Johannes Kepler University and work as a Research Scientist at <a href="https://www.nx-ai.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">NXAI</a>. My research interests include linear sequence mixers, sparse attention, LLM pre- and post-training and efficient machine learning in general.</p><p>My writing here focuses on understanding how ML methods work, implementing them, and figuring out the practical details along the way.</p>{/* Hidden for now: the latest post has no code to follow along with.
